# ── Local dev (npm run dev) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Default: fetch shapes from /api/overrides/bus-shapes.json (sibling repo).
# Force GitHub raw instead:
# VITE_OVERRIDES_BUS_SHAPES_URL=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/UNGemini/morgan-travelers-overrides/main/bus-shapes.json
# Custom overrides repo path (default: ../morgan-travelers-overrides):
# OVERRIDES_REPO_PATH=/absolute/path/to/morgan-travelers-overrides
#
# ── Submit modes ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Contributors choose in the UI:
#   • GitHub account (recommended) — OAuth → fork → PR as the user
#   • Bot account — site PAT opens PR on the overrides repo
#
# Bot mode (fine-grained PAT with Contents + Pull requests on overrides repo):
# OVERRIDES_GITHUB_TOKEN=github_pat_xxxxxxxx
# OVERRIDES_REPO=UNGemini/morgan-travelers-overrides
# OVERRIDES_BASE_BRANCH=main
#
# OAuth mode (GitHub OAuth App — https://github.com/settings/developers):
#   Homepage: http://127.0.0.1:5173  (and production origin)
#   Callback: http://127.0.0.1:5173/api/auth/callback
#             https://YOUR_PAGES_DOMAIN/api/auth/callback
# GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
# GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Optional override (defaults from request origin):
# GITHUB_OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI=http://127.0.0.1:5173/api/auth/callback
#
# Without OAuth + without bot token: bot submit still saves pending/ + local review link.
# OAuth submit without login returns 401 (UI prompts Log in with GitHub).
#
# Docs: docs/local-overrides.md
# npm run overrides:status | overrides:pending | overrides:merge -- pending/x.json

# ── Production (Cloudflare Pages secrets) ────────────────────────────
# OVERRIDES_REPO=UNGemini/morgan-travelers-overrides
# OVERRIDES_GITHUB_TOKEN=github_pat_xxxxxxxx
# OVERRIDES_BASE_BRANCH=main
# GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
# GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
# GITHUB_OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI=https://YOUR_DOMAIN/api/auth/callback
